OL,3,GNEWSAP&R urged to speed up review of
OL,4,Arelocation grants
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's top political committee is
OL,7,Fbeing urged to prioritise a review of
OL,8,Frelocation allowances amid concerns it
OL,9,Fis putting pressure on rental prices.
OL,11,FPolicy and Resources (P&R) said in June
OL,12,Flast year the review was "on track" to
OL,13,Fbe finished by the end of September
OL,14,F2025.
OL,16,FDeputy Tom Rylatt, from Forward
OL,17,FGuernsey, said the review should "be a
OL,18,Fpriority for P&R" and the delay was
OL,19,Fdisappointing.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
