OL,3,GNEWSAP&R urged to speed up review of
OL,4,Arelocation grants
OL,5,
OL,6,FP&R President Lindsay de Sausmarez said
OL,7,F"several stages of work on the review
OL,8,Fhave been completed" and the committee
OL,9,Fwas due to consider it again shortly.
